# Local secrets for run_pipeline.py. THIS FILE IS GIT-IGNORED: never commit it, paste it into a chat or an issue,
# or copy it into a config file. A new machine starts from .env.example.
#
# CARTO basemap API key (free). CARTO's raster basemaps need one: without a key CARTO still answers, but every
# tile has "API KEY REQUIRED" drawn into it, so the pipeline refuses to request CARTO tiles without a key and
# falls back to the offline layers or a plain background.
#   1. request a key at https://www.carto.com/basemaps/apikey/   (free, emailed to you)
#   2. put it after the = below, no quotes, no spaces
# Free tier: 5 million tile requests / month, non-commercial use; CARTO and OpenStreetMap attribution must stay on
# the maps (the pipeline draws it). Do not share the key or reuse it across unrelated projects.
CARTO_API_KEY=
